      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In the investigation of children with leg aches, it is essential to identify any underlying organic disease. Growing pain is a poorly named, nebulous entity that can be diagnosed only by exclusion. The greatest diagnostic error is to make a diagnosis of growing pains while overlooking some serious underlying condition."},
